              "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "Stop at the first yes. The order runs from most specific to most general, because the general questions swallow the specific ones — “is this a persisting condition?” is true of invalid input and of a Pending record as well as of a stale account. Question 4 covers row states that need nothing; question 5 covers conditions that need acting on at any scope, including a single row. A row that needs a decision is not a badge and is not nothing.",
