                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The domain atom. Sign and currency are always rendered, so direction survives greyscale and colour blindness. IBM Plex Mono gives tabular figures and the frame right-aligns, so decimals line up down a column — which is why the captions here are right-aligned too: every cell is one right-edged stack. The hero sits on its own row because a 48 px value cannot share a grid with a 13 px one.",
