              "gap": 3,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "p2Eno",
                  "name": "Name",
                  "fill": "$color-text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Notice",
                  "fontFamily": "$type-family-body",
                  "fontSize": "$type-size-heading-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "UtaeJ",
                  "name": "Contract",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "One shape behind every message the product shows: an icon, a title, a body, and at most one action. Inline alert, page banner, global banner and toast are the same molecule placed differently and toned differently — the decision tables in 00 · README choose between those placements, and this is the thing they are choosing. Title and action are switchable, because a one-line confirmation and a page-level failure are the same component with different parts showing.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$type-family-body",
                  "fontSize": "$type-size-body-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "x3lqx",
              "name": "Specimens",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "$color-bg-surface",
              "cornerRadius": "$radius-md",
              "stroke": "$color-border-default",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
