                          "name": "Note",
                          "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "A tab carries a count only when the count is actionable. A report has no backlog, so the count is switched off rather than showing a meaningless zero.\n\nBoth specimens are the same height here on purpose: the list and the tabs are peers, and drawing one as a tall card beside a short strip implied a hierarchy that does not exist.",
