                  "id": "G91dii",
                  "name": "Scale",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Drawn to scale — one pixel here is 1.78 real pixels, and each row is as wide as its viewport. The composition is identical in all three; what changes is how much is left for the content.",
