                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "“The row is the target” is true for a pointer and impossible for everything else. A ledger row selects, opens, and sometimes carries a notice with its own buttons — three interactive things inside one that claims to be a single target. Nesting a control inside a control is invalid markup and unreachable by keyboard, so the row cannot be a button or a link.",
