                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "PDgC3",
                  "name": "Contract",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The data is the decoration. Every value is readable as text near its mark, so no chart depends on hovering or on colour — the series label sits with the series, not in a legend you have to cross-reference. Chart colours never include income green, so a green bar never suggests income when it means a category. Axes start at zero for magnitudes.",
