                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "qINvy",
                  "name": "Contract",
                  "fill": "$color-text-secondary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "A short blocking decision. Focus moves in on open, is trapped while modal, Escape closes, and focus returns to whatever opened it. Initial focus lands on the least destructive action — for an irreversible choice that is Cancel, not the red button. The confirmation names the record and the amount, because 'Are you sure?' asks about nothing. Red is never the only signal; the verb says what happens.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.45,
                  "fontFamily": "$type-family-body",
                  "fontSize": "$type-size-body-sm",
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
