                  "fill": "$color-text-primary",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Deleting or altering a money-bearing record is a consequential submission under SC 3.3.4, which asks for review, correction, or reversal. A confirmation that says “Delete this transaction?” satisfies the letter and none of the point: the person clicking it cannot tell which row they right-clicked. Naming the merchant, the amount and the date makes the dialog a review step rather than a speed bump, and it is the last place a mistake is cheap.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.55,
                  "fontFamily": "$type-family-body",
                  "fontSize": 11,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
